        "description": "<p>This is simple widget of showing youtube subscribe button. Easy to use. Previously Youtube Subscribe Button Widget.</p>\n<p>Features<br />\n* Enable or disable full layout.<br />\n* Show or hide subscriber count.<br />\n* Supports channel names and channel IDs.<br />\n* Updated widget code for current WordPress releases.</p>\n<p>Also see my other plugins<br />\n* <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/embed-page-facebook/\" title=\"Embed Page Facebook\" rel=\"ugc\">Embed Page Facebook</a> <br />\n* <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/social-link-on-footer/\" title=\"Social Link on Footer\" rel=\"ugc\">Social Link on Footer</a> <br />\n* <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/social-profile-link/\" title=\"Social Profiles Link\" rel=\"ugc\">Social Profiles Link</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://apsaraaruna.com\" title=\"Official website\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Official website</a></p>\n",
        "installation": "<p>Upload the Youtube Subscribe Widget to your blog, Activate it.</p>\n<p>1, 2, 3: You&#8217;re done!</p>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.2.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Modernized widget code for current WordPress versions.</li>\n<li>Fixed widget admin form defaults and sanitization.</li>\n<li>Only loads the YouTube platform script when the widget is rendered.</li>\n<li>Added support for channel IDs in the frontend output.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.17</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>tested with 6.3</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.16</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>tested with 6.3</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.15</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>tested with 6.2.2</li>\n</ul>\n<p>= 1.0.14=<br />\n* tested with 6.0.2</p>\n<h4>1.0.13</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Bug fixed</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.12</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Test on 5.8</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.11</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Test on 5.6</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.10</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Test on 5.5</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.9</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Speed improved</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.8</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated to new Youtube API</li>\n<li>bug fixed</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.7</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Test on 5.4</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.6</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Tested on 5.3</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.5</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Brand Name removed.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.4</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Bug fixed.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add &#8216;Theme&#8217; customizable</li>\n<li>Tested on wordpress 5.0.1</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add &#8216;Subscriber count&#8217; customizable </li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add &#8216;Layout&#8217; customizable</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fresh version</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
